# INPUTS：字符串取值。空文本 + 无默认值 ⇒ 按提交原文交付（:1190-1204），
# process.InputString 写 RESULTS:0（Process.cs:432-436），脚本打 INPUTS=HELLO。
case: input_str
target: REPLAY_INPUT_STR
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameProc.Function/FunctionIdentifier.cs:871-913
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:1190-1204
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameProc/Process.cs:432-436
--- inputs
submit HELLO
--- expect-console
START-INPUT-STR
INPUTS=HELLO
END-INPUT-STR
--- expect-vars
RESULTS:0 = "HELLO"
